# W11b, a (k2): A on the lobby gate's first line (stag0101) without the gate form: the press goes to the game at once and
# the departure runs; the relay holds a's barrier for the loading-screen prompt (c's row). B (DW4_ONLINE_TEST_GATE_FORM=0,
# autochoice back): Back to the lobby, a reload of the lobby next to the gate (stagML11 point 1, the census names it) on
# a's own story; nothing of the field was played (key 4, which c's story has and a's lacks, never set in a's engine).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until frames>=120 fail key:4=1
log own story at home
idle until epoch>=@120
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 0 until frames>=150
log a confirmed the gate
idle until frames>=1500 fail stage=stag0101
idle until stage=stagml11,control
log a back in the lobby
idle until frames>=120 fail key:4=1
log own story still
